    "The sole operative product correction constructs the whole actual Result range with the original checked Decoded_Byte(Data, Item, I - Result First) projection. The public specification is byte-identical, including full Canonical Pre, complete every-byte Post, Global/Depends, Always_Terminates and the original accepted input/output domains. The aggregate reads incoming Result bounds, not incoming element values; null ranges evaluate no component. The former private growing-prefix invariant concerns incremental partial construction; complete aggregate initialization, exact final correspondence, RTE, alias/noninterference and termination remain actual same-source proof obligations.",
    "Original checked per-byte projection and complete Post remain evaluated. There is no assertion-policy change, suppression, Assume, output allocation cap, weaker Pre/Post, revised accepted case, deadline increase or diagnostic waiver. Existing malformed alphabet/padding/unused bits, empty/nondefault/interior/high-index controls, callers and native exported boundaries retain exact original bytes.",
    "The complete manifest differs only by the original normalized decoder-body digest literal inside the existing CONTRACT_PINS update mapping. Every effective and literal table row is independently recomputed with unchanged isolated original normalizer definitions; the complete required proof roster, policy functions, floor, sole unanalyzed C boundary and every declared core body/spec enrollment remain unchanged. Registration changes only its existing actual manifest hash and one source-only provenance binding.",
    "Root actual source-only finalizer e5bf22 returned zero after the preserved initial preparation guard failure 163c1c. The original refresher already performed the correct one-literal update; the finalizer verified whole manifest bytes and completed the same partial Source16 without recopying Source15. Both full source trees remain stable and Source15 is byte-exact to its frozen complete inventory.",
    "Actual Source15 acquisition interruption and the independent observational diagnostic establish an expensive repeated checked prefix-validation route and a reproduced gamma SQL-to-native-postflight interval. They do not establish unique cost dominance, original ephemeral call identity, nontermination or correction efficacy. This source qualification authorizes only the original diagnostic preparation interface."
